u par la v0.1, n'est pas implémenté : le rétablir relève d'une version suivante, pas d'une retouche. Les paramètres de la v0.1 restent en place et ne sont pas réécrits.", "motif_version": "", "faiblesse": "Trois états seulement. Les passages d'un état à l'autre sont brutaux et peuvent se produire près d'un point de retournement.", "allocation_courante": [{"asset_id": "ALTAPROFITS:FONDS-EN-EURO-NETISSIMA", "weight_pct": 50.0}, {"asset_id": "IE00BKBF6H24", "weight_pct": 21.0}, {"asset_id": "IE00BL25JN58", "weight_pct": 9.0}, {"asset_id": "IE00BMG6Z448", "weight_pct": 6.67}, {"asset_id": "LU0290358497", "weight_pct": 6.67}, {"asset_id": "LU1829219390", "weight_pct": 6.67}], "indicateurs": {"debut": "2022-07-05", "fin": "2026-09-18", "nb_seances": 1072, "perf_origine_pct": 31.66, "perf_annualisee_pct": 6.68, "perf_5j_pct": -0.32, "perf_20j_pct": -0.21, "drawdown_max_pct": -5.94, "vol_periode_pct": 5.08, "vol_20j_pct": 3.87, "nb_arbitrages": 85, "valeur_base_100": 131.66}, "nb_decisions": 85, "versions": {"v0.2": {"indicateurs": {"debut": "2022-07-05", "fin": "2026-09-18", "nb_seances": 1072, "perf_origine_pct": 31.66, "perf_annualisee_pct": 6.68, "perf_5j_pct": -0.32, "perf_20j_pct": -0.21, "drawdown_max_pct": -5.94, "vol_periode_pct": 5.08, "vol_20j_pct": 3.87, "nb_arbitrages": 85, "valeur_base_100": 131.66}, "note": "Moyenne 100 jours et trois thèmes, seuls supports EUR disponibles.", "filtre_tendance": "sma_100", "nb_decisions": 85, "allocation_finale": [{"asset_id": "ALTAPROFITS:FONDS-EN-EURO-NETISSIMA", "weight_pct": 50.0}, {"asset_id": "IE00BKBF6H24", "weight_pct": 21.0}, {"asset_id": "IE00BL25JN58", "weight_pct": 9.0}, {"asset_id": "IE00BMG6Z448", "weight_pct": 6.67}, {"asset_id": "LU0290358497", "weight_pct": 6.67}, {"asset_id": "LU1829219390", "weight_pct": 6.67}], "indicateurs_fenetre_commune": {"debut": "2022-09-20", "fin": "2026-09-18", "nb_seances": 1017, "perf_origine_pct": 37.29, "perf_annualisee_pct": 8.17, "perf_5j_pct": -0.32, "perf_20j_pct": -0.21, "d